<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_7bRkYCGhasXtZ4VP8hzM1mjwScRh" lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3lg58otdl8my-.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/41b5e_o-w2xun.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1cmnso0jnkwt6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2-k_577svdq9-.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-2l6qdc9b47pt9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><title>Examples · MCPCN</title><meta name="description" content="React components and workflow blocks for human-controlled MCP Apps."/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.0-2l4nus4v8l3.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="site-nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">M</span>MCPCN</a><nav><a href="/docs">Docs</a><a href="/components">Components</a><a href="/blocks">Blocks</a><a href="/examples">Examples</a><a href="/playground">Playground</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/create">Create</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui" class="button">GitHub</a></div></header><main><span class="eyebrow">Persistent reference workflows</span><h1>Review. Confirm. Verify.</h1><p class="lede">Five React applications connect real MCP tools to a private local SQLite workspace. Their reviewed records and audit survive a restart.</p><p><a class="button" href="/docs/reference-workflows">Run the reference workbench</a></p><div class="catalog-grid"><article class="catalog-card"><span>Example 0<!-- -->1</span><h3>HR candidate review</h3><img src="/reference-workflows/hr-candidate-review.png" alt="HR candidate review in the actual local workbench with authored check data" width="1280" height="1000" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)"/><p>Inspect supplied evidence,scores,gaps and risks; persist an explicit reviewer decision and note.</p><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/tree/main/examples/hr-candidate-review">Read example source</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>Example 0<!-- -->2</span><h3>Document extraction review</h3><img src="/reference-workflows/document-extraction.png" alt="Document extraction review in the actual local workbench with authored check data" width="1280" height="1000" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)"/><p>Submit UTF-8 text,inspect source matches,correct extracted fields and confirm their persistent save.</p><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/tree/main/examples/document-extraction">Read example source</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>Example 0<!-- -->3</span><h3>Ecommerce checkout review</h3><img src="/reference-workflows/ecommerce-checkout-review.png" alt="Ecommerce checkout review in the actual local workbench with authored check data" width="1280" height="1000" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)"/><p>Review prices,shipping,tax and return terms; refresh an expired quote and record one uncharged order.</p><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/tree/main/examples/ecommerce-checkout-review">Read example source</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>Example 0<!-- -->4</span><h3>SaaS admin change</h3><img src="/reference-workflows/admin-settings-change.png" alt="SaaS admin change in the actual local workbench with authored check data" width="1280" height="1000" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)"/><p>Review actual reference preferences,affected members and before/after values; apply a change or a fresh reviewed rollback.</p><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/tree/main/examples/admin-settings-change">Read example source</a></article><article class="catalog-card"><span>Example 0<!-- -->5</span><h3>Multi-step research workflow</h3><img src="/reference-workflows/research-workflow.png" alt="Multi-step research workflow in the actual local workbench with authored check data" width="1280" height="1000" loading="lazy" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)"/><p>Gather configured sources,inspect complete text and failures,retry one failed source and save a human conclusion.</p><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/tree/main/examples/research-workflow">Read example source</a></article></div><p>No payment,candidate messaging,SSO,OCR or AI provider is connected. These are local reference applications; production identity/providers and external-host compatibility require separate integration and acceptance.</p><p><a href="/docs/server">Build the validated MCP server integration</a>. Component callbacks are requests; the server enforces the authorized principal,current revision and exact reviewed terms.</p></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer><div><strong>MCPCN</strong><p>Human control for agentic apps.</p></div><div><a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Security</a></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[14058,[\"/_next/static/immut